<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδειλι-άω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω [ᾱ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be very fearful, play the coward, flinch from
				danger</i> or <i>toil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.12.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				480c
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐν ἰσχυροῖς μαθήμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					535b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				504a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ψυχαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.15.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.16.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				33.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				10.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ διαπονεῖσθαι</span>”
				<i>shrink from . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					10.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν μάχην</span>”
				<i>to be afraid of,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.84.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
